  "why_this_one": "The bronze spear-knight statue, 4 m tall, with spear and shield: about fifty to an arena in loose ranks down its west side and a regiment block at the south-west, turned 30-120 degrees to face in. Its one 4-key idle plays at the object's speed (ZzzObject.cpp:3725-3747). docs/worlds/devil-square-port.md, Part B section 1.2.",
  "material_note": "Read off the art: kni00 and kni01 are bronze plate, the cuirass, pauldrons, greaves, shield and spear. painted_steel, MU's metal as it painted it, with the cast grain plate takes (a blade's brushed grain bakes stripes into plate). First built as plate_steel with the Blood Castle orc's fine grain: fully metallic, the bronze reflected near white under this sheet and the shields bloomed out (shots at 124,98 and 124,110, 2026-10-10).",
  "effects_note": "MuMain's only arm: rain splashes at its shoulder bones 23 and 31 (RenderObjectVisual, ZzzObject.cpp:3068-3087), BITMAP_RAIN_CIRCLE+1. Not built: Devil Square's rain is our rain system's (docs/worlds/devil-square-port.md).",
